  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1202.45 Core activities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1202.45 \"Core activities\" means operations that are central to the manufacturing or business of the source. The term excludes all non-core activities as defined in Env-A 1203.53.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
